dcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Acetone+Shaker", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Acetone+Shaker", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Acetone+Shaker", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Acetone+Shaker", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/1710256877", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Acetone+Shaker", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Acetone+Shaker&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2023 New West Records"]}, {"t": 6708, "time": "01:51:48", "artist": "Tomorrow Comes The Harvest", "title": "The Happening", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Tomorrow+Comes+The+Harvest+The+Happening", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Tomorrow+Comes+The+Harvest+The+Happening", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Tomorrow+Comes+The+Harvest+The+Happening", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Tomorrow+Comes+The+Harvest+The+Happening", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/1837544263", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Tomorrow+Comes+The+Harvest+The+Happening", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Tomorrow+Comes+The+Harvest+The+Happening&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2025 Axis Records"]}], "counts": {"high": 5, "mid": 13, "low": 3}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:02:01", "end": "00:02:55", "text": "Hello, you're tuned in to M5 on FBi Radio with me, Lilly, or Killian. Before we go any further, I'd like to take a moment to acknowledge that we're broadcasting on Gadigal Country tonight. Sovereignty was never ceded. This is, was, and always will be Aboriginal land. We have a guest mix from an artist called Headaches tonight. They're a Gadigal-based producer, vocalist and songwriter and a dear friend. So it's really exciting to have Mel on the show in a place of music and in a little bit, about 20 minutes, half an hour, we'll hear a guest mix from them."}, {"start": "00:15:01", "end": "00:15:36", "text": "This one underneath me is a new one by Fine. It's called Goodbye Brain off a new record called Jazz Dreams that I'm really enjoying. Before that we had Where Life Begins by Madonna. And at the top there was So Bad by Headaches, our guest mix artist for the week. It's a tongue twister. And that is off their new record called We'll Make Our Beds When We Get Home. It's an EP off Sydney Label, Double Dot. Shout out to the team."}, {"start": "00:27:20", "end": "00:27:52", "text": "Lilly, this is my last song before we hand it over to a guest mix from Headaches. Underneath Me is a really nice dub remix of the Cocteau Twins 50-50 Clown. Before that we had Across the Universe by Fiona Apple and at the top there was Richard and it's a song called Loving You to Death. yeah i hope you're enjoying and stay tuned for a really lovely guest mix"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Luminous Nights", "artists": [{"name": "SYNTHWAVE SPECTRUM"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:35"}, "track": {"title": "So Bad", "artists": [{"name": "Headaches"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:19"}, "track": {"title": "Where Life Begins", "artists": [{"name": "Madonna"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:14:17"}, "track": {"title": "Goodbye brain", "artists": [{"name": "Fine"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timesta